# This repository holds release binaries, documentation, and the
# GitHub Pages landing page -- no PUMA Analyzer application source
# code (that is Python/C, in a separate private repository). The
# lines below stop GitHub's language-detection bar from being skewed
# by the landing page's build tooling (Tailwind) so it does not
# misrepresent this repo as a JavaScript/CSS project.

package.json linguist-vendored
package-lock.json linguist-vendored
tailwind.config.js linguist-vendored
tw-input.css linguist-vendored
docs/tailwind.css linguist-generated=true
docs/index.html linguist-documentation
docs/*.txt linguist-documentation
docs/*.xml linguist-documentation
